> +allbox;
> +lb lb lb
> +l l l.
> +Interface	Attribute	Value
> +T{
>  .BR raise ()
> -function is thread-safe.
> +T}	Thread safety	MT-Safe
> +.TE
>  .SH CONFORMING TO
>  C89, C99, POSIX.1-2001.
>  .SH NOTES
